<title>USA: Vyrex, Immune Response in pact.</title>
<headline>Vyrex, Immune Response in pact.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vyrex Corp and Immune Response Corp said they signed a letter of intent for the development of treatments for injuries to the human nervous system.</p>
<p>The collaboration will focus on the discovery of proteins and small molecules that are involved in nerve growth and repair.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
